{
  "id": "RAW_e94d72bd58",
  "title": "Baseten 发布 bison-1 和 groundhog-1，登顶决策模型指数",
  "url": "https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/20/baseten-bison-1-groundhog-1-gemma-4-decision-models/",
  "date": "2026-11-21 12:01:05",
  "author": "Asif Razzaq",
  "siteName": "MarkTechPost",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"td-a-rec td-a-rec-id-content_top  tdi_77 td_block_template_1\">\n   <!-- MTP Preferred Source badge : DESKTOP (plain link, no script; hidden below 640px) -->\n   <div id=\"mtp-pref-desk\">\n    <a class=\"mtp-pref-btn\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Add Marktechpost as a preferred source on Google\"><img src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/googleg/1x/googleg_standard_color_128dp.png\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"mtp-pref-txt\"><span style=\"display:block!important\">Add as a preferred</span><span style=\"display:block!important\">source on Google</span></span></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Baseten has released bison-1 and groundhog-1, 2 open-weight decision models built on Google’s <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/models/gemma/gemma-4/\">Gemma 4</a>. Decision models do not write text. They return calibrated probabilities for yes/no, choice and score questions. The Baseten bison-1 decision model scores 76 on the <a href=\"https://artificialanalysis.ai/evaluations/artificial-analysis-decision-index\">Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1</a>. That ranks #1 of 19. Both models raise context from 16k to 128k tokens and accept images. For routing, triage and guardrail pipelines, that means full policies and histories in one call.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-tl-dr\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TL;DR</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li><strong>Size:</strong> bison-1 is 31B dense. groundhog-1 is a 26B MoE with about 4B active. Both take 128k tokens (131,072).</li>\n   <li><strong>Runs on:</strong> Baseten Model APIs, plus open BF16 weights on Hugging Face. No inference GPU or quantized builds are listed. BF16 weights alone are about 62 GB (bison-1) and 52 GB (groundhog-1), by our arithmetic.</li>\n   <li><strong>Performance:</strong> bison-1 scores 76 on AA Decision Index v2.1, 1 point above Liquid AI’s d1.2-ultra (75).</li>\n   <li><strong>Best:</strong> When2Call, 98 (rank #1).</li>\n   <li><strong>Worst:</strong> AA-Omniscience-Decision v1.1, 60 (rank #11).</li>\n   <li><strong>Bottom line:</strong> Best: top-ranked, best-calibrated decisions (Brier 0.14) over 128k tokens at $0.10 per 1M input tokens. Worst: groundhog-1 has no official index score yet, and every number is self-reported.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <h2 id=\"h-what-are-bison-1-and-groundhog-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are bison-1 and groundhog-1?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">bison-1 is a 31B decision model from Baseten that post-trains Gemma 4 31B to return calibrated probabilities. groundhog-1 is the cheaper sibling. It fine-tunes <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/groundhog-1\">Gemma 4 26B-A4B</a>, a mixture-of-experts model with about 4B active parameters per token.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both join Baseten’s existing lineup: mammoth-1 (27B), elephant-1 (9B) and joey-1 (2B). Those 3 sit on Qwen backbones. The new pair is Baseten’s first on what it calls an American backbone.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-a-decision-model-work\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does a decision model work?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A request carries 1 <code>state</code> and any number of <code>questions</code>. The state is text, optionally with images. Each question has a type: <code>noul</code> (yes/no), <code>choice</code> (named options) or <code>score</code> (ordered levels).</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The model answers every question in a single prefill pass. It returns P(yes), or the chosen option with a <code>probabilities</code> field. No output tokens are generated. Baseten’s <a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/the-best-decision-models-in-the-world-mammoth-1-and-elephant-1/\">earlier launch post</a> lists ticket triage, spam detection, jailbreak guardrails and LLM routing as target tasks.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Requests longer than the trained limit are refused, not truncated. Pipelines that assume silent truncation will need a length check.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-why-is-bison-1-better-calibrated\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why is bison-1 better calibrated?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Baseten credits two sources: the Gemma base and more “soft labels” in the training mix. Soft labels use probability targets instead of 1 fixed correct answer. The model learns to report uncertainty that tracks how often it is right.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The result is a Brier score of 0.14, the lowest on the index. Baseten puts d1.2-ultra at 0.15. Lower is better.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-bison-1-score-on-benchmarks\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does bison-1 score on benchmarks?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On AA Decision Index v2.1, bison-1 scores 76. <a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/d1-2\">Liquid AI’s d1.2-ultra</a> scores 75 and mammoth-1 scores 71. The index blends 6 evaluations, led by AA-Paperclip at 30%.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>The <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/bison-1\">bison-1 model card</a> breaks out each component:</strong></p>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>When2Call: 98 (#1)</li>\n   <li>EvalSafe-O*NET-AA: 93 (#1)</li>\n   <li>AA-Symmetry v1.1: 89 (#1)</li>\n   <li>AA-Paperclip: 73 (#2)</li>\n   <li>HLE-MultiChoice v1.1: 51 (#1)</li>\n   <li>AA-Omniscience-Decision v1.1: 60 (#11)</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">bison-1 ranks first on 4 of 6 components. Knowledge-heavy decisions are its weak spot.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On long context, Baseten reports LongMemEval M (128k) of 84.8 for bison-1 and 77.4 for groundhog-1. LongMemEval S reads 87.1 and 79.3. groundhog-1 has no official index score yet. Baseten expects it to match mammoth-1.</p>\n  <div id=\"mtp-bsn-wrap\" style=\"margin:24px auto;\">\n   <iframe class=\"lazyload\" id=\"mtp-bsn-frame\" title=\"Baseten bison-1 and groundhog-1 interactive explainer\" loading=\"lazy\" srcdoc=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width,initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;&lt;link href=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800&amp;display=swap&quot; rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot;&gt;&lt;style&gt;html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:transparent}&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;mtp-bsn-x&quot;&gt;\n&lt;style&gt;\n#mtp-bsn-x{--bg:#0E0F0C;--panel:#17191A;--line:#2A2D2B;--txt:#F4F1E8;--mut:#A9A79F;--grn:#5FD37C;--yel:#F5C754;--lil:#C7A6F2;--org:#F08A5D;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg)!important;color:var(--txt)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 22px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:1.45}\n#mtp-bsn-x *{box-sizing:border-box}\n#mtp-bsn-x hr,#mtp-bsn-x p:empty,#mtp-bsn-x del,#mtp-bsn-x s{display:none!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x code{background:#22251F!important;color:var(--grn)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}\n#mtp-bsn-x .hd{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-bsn-x .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0E0F0C!important;background:var(--grn)!important;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700}\n#mtp-bsn-x h3{margin:8px 0 2px;font-size:22px;color:var(--txt)!important;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n#mtp-bsn-x .sub{color:var(--mut)!important;font-size:13.5px;margin:0}\n#mtp-bsn-x .chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-bsn-x .chip{font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;color:var(--txt)!important;background:#141613!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .chip b{color:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;margin:16px 0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-bsn-x .tab{background:transparent!important;border:0!important;color:var(--mut)!important;font:600 13.5px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:9px 12px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:2px solid transparent!important;margin-bottom:-1px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .tab.on{color:var(--txt)!important;border-bottom-color:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .pane{display:none;animation:bsnIn .35s ease}\n#mtp-bsn-x .pane.on{display:block}\n@keyframes bsnIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n#mtp-bsn-x .card{background:var(--panel)!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:12px;padding:14px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr 1.1fr;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}\n#mtp-bsn-x .node{background:#121411!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;transition:all .35s ease;opacity:.35;min-height:150px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .node.lit{opacity:1;border-color:var(--grn)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--grn),0 0 22px rgba(95,211,124,.18)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .node h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .st{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--txt)!important;background:#1B1E1A!important;border-radius:8px;padding:8px;border:1px dashed #3A3E38!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .q{font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n#mtp-bsn-x .qt{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;color:#0E0F0C!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .core{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center}\n#mtp-bsn-x .orb{width:74px;height:74px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%,var(--yel),#B88A1E)!important;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;color:#0E0F0C!important;font-size:13px;margin:6px auto}\n#mtp-bsn-x .node.lit .orb{animation:bsnPulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite}\n@keyframes bsnPulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.08);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(245,199,84,.5)}}\n#mtp-bsn-x .pr{margin-top:6px;font-size:12px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .pr .bar{height:8px;background:#23261F!important;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:3px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .pr .fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--grn)!important;transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .ctl{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-bsn-x .btn{background:#1C1F1B!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;color:var(--txt)!important;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 12px;font:600 12.5px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n#mtp-bsn-x .btn:hover{border-color:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .btn.pri{background:var(--grn)!important;color:#0E0F0C!important;border-color:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .cap{font-size:13px;color:var(--txt)!important;margin:10px 0 0;min-height:38px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dots{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-left:auto}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#33372F!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dot.on{background:var(--grn)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .seg{display:inline-flex;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#mtp-bsn-x .seg button{background:transparent!important;border:0!important;color:var(--mut)!important;padding:7px 12px;font:600 12.5px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}\n#mtp-bsn-x .seg button.on{background:#23271F!important;color:var(--txt)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr 60px;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:9px 0;font-size:13px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row .nm{color:var(--txt)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row .tr{height:22px;background:#1B1D19!important;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row .fl{height:100%;width:0;border-radius:5px;transition:width 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row .vl{font-weight:800;text-align:right;color:var(--txt)!important;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n#mtp-bsn-x .rk{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin-left:6px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin-top:8px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dist{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px;height:120px;padding:8px 4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dcol{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;height:100%}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dbar{width:100%;max-width:56px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;transition:height .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);background:var(--lil)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dlab{font-size:11px;color:var(--mut)!important;margin-top:4px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .dval{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--txt)!important;margin-bottom:3px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .big{font-size:34px;font-weight:800;color:var(--grn)!important;line-height:1}\n#mtp-bsn-x .lineup{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl{background:#121411!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s ease;text-align:left;color:var(--txt)!important;font-family:inherit}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl.on{border-color:var(--grn)!important;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--grn)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl .n{font-weight:800;font-size:14px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl .p{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .mdl .new{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:800;color:#0E0F0C!important;background:var(--yel)!important;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;margin-left:4px;vertical-align:middle}\n#mtp-bsn-x .det{margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .kv{background:#121411!important;border:1px solid var(--line)!important;border-radius:8px;padding:9px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .kv .k{font-size:10.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .kv .v{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;margin-top:2px;color:var(--txt)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:11px;color:var(--mut)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .foot a{color:var(--mut)!important}\n#mtp-bsn-x .brand{color:#76B900!important;font-weight:700}\n@media (max-width:640px){\n#mtp-bsn-x{padding:16px 14px 12px}\n#mtp-bsn-x h3{font-size:18px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n#mtp-bsn-x .node{min-height:0}\n#mtp-bsn-x .row{grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 44px;font-size:12px}\n#mtp-bsn-x .grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n#mtp-bsn-x .lineup{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .det{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n#mtp-bsn-x .tab{padding:8px 8px;font-size:12.5px}\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;hd&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;Base Labs · Baseten&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;h3&gt;bison-1 + groundhog-1: decision models on Gemma 4&lt;/h3&gt;\n    &lt;p class=&quot;sub&quot;&gt;They return calibrated probabilities, not text. Released November 20, 2026.&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;chips&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;chip&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;76&lt;/b&gt; AA Decision Index v2.1&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;chip&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;128k&lt;/b&gt; context&lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;span class=&quot;chip&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;0.14&lt;/b&gt; Brier&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;tabs&quot; role=&quot;tablist&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;tab on&quot; data-t=&quot;how&quot;&gt;How it works&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;bench&quot;&gt;Benchmarks&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;cal&quot;&gt;Calibration&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;button class=&quot;tab&quot; data-t=&quot;line&quot;&gt;Lineup &amp;amp; price&lt;/button&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- HOW --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;pane on&quot; data-p=&quot;how&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;flow&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;0&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h4&gt;1 · State&lt;/h4&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;st&quot;&gt;Policy doc + chat history (up to 128k tokens), optional images. Example: &quot;My payouts have been failing for 3 days.&quot;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node core&quot; data-s=&quot;2&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h4&gt;3 · 1 prefill pass&lt;/h4&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;orb&quot;&gt;bison-1&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#A9A79F&quot;&gt;No output tokens generated&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;3&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;h4&gt;4 · Probabilities&lt;/h4&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;pr&quot;&gt;urgent? P(yes)&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fill&quot; data-w=&quot;82&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;pr&quot;&gt;team: billing&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fill&quot; data-w=&quot;64&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;pr&quot;&gt;severity score&lt;div class=&quot;bar&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fill&quot; data-w=&quot;47&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;node&quot; data-s=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:12px;min-height:0&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;h4&gt;2 · Questions (any number, 1 request)&lt;/h4&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;q&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;qt&quot; style=&quot;background:#5FD37C&quot;&gt;noul&lt;/span&gt; Is this urgent? (yes/no)&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;q&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;qt&quot; style=&quot;background:#F5C754&quot;&gt;choice&lt;/span&gt; Which team: billing, tech, sales?&lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;q&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;qt&quot; style=&quot;background:#C7A6F2&quot;&gt;score&lt;/span&gt; Rate severity on ordered levels&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;p class=&quot;cap&quot; id=&quot;bsn-cap&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;ctl&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; id=&quot;bsn-prev&quot;&gt;← Back&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;btn pri&quot; id=&quot;bsn-next&quot;&gt;Next step →&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; id=&quot;bsn-play&quot;&gt;▶ Auto-play&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;dots&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Output values in step 4 are illustrative. Request format from the bison-1 model card.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- BENCH --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;pane&quot; data-p=&quot;bench&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;bsn-seg&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;button class=&quot;on&quot; data-b=&quot;idx&quot;&gt;AA Decision Index v2.1&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button data-b=&quot;cmp&quot;&gt;bison-1 components&lt;/button&gt;\n    &lt;button data-b=&quot;lme&quot;&gt;Long context (128k)&lt;/button&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot; id=&quot;bsn-bars&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot; id=&quot;bsn-bnote&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- CAL --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;pane&quot; data-p=&quot;cal&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;grid2&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5FD37C;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;Training target&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;seg&quot; id=&quot;bsn-lab&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;button class=&quot;on&quot; data-l=&quot;hard&quot;&gt;Hard label&lt;/button&gt;\n        &lt;button data-l=&quot;soft&quot;&gt;Soft label&lt;/button&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;dist&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dcol&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dval&quot; id=&quot;d0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dbar&quot; id=&quot;b0&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dlab&quot;&gt;billing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dcol&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dval&quot; id=&quot;d1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dbar&quot; id=&quot;b1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dlab&quot;&gt;tech&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n        &lt;div class=&quot;dcol&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dval&quot; id=&quot;d2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dbar&quot; id=&quot;b2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;dlab&quot;&gt;sales&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;cap&quot; id=&quot;bsn-lcap&quot; style=&quot;min-height:0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Target values are illustrative. Baseten says more soft labels in the mix drove a major calibration gain.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;div class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5FD37C;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;Brier score (lower is better)&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; style=&quot;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 44px&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nm&quot;&gt;bison-1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl&quot; data-w=&quot;14&quot; style=&quot;background:#F5C754&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vl&quot;&gt;0.14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; style=&quot;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 44px&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nm&quot;&gt;d1.2-ultra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl&quot; data-w=&quot;15&quot; style=&quot;background:#5B5E58&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vl&quot;&gt;0.15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n      &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;margin:10px 0 0&quot;&gt;Brier is the mean squared gap between stated confidence and being right, on a 0 to 1 scale. Bars are drawn on that full 0 to 1 scale.&lt;/p&gt;\n      &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;bison-1 has the lowest Brier score on the index (self-reported). The d1.2-ultra figure is Baseten's.&lt;/p&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- LINE --&gt;\n&lt;div class=&quot;pane&quot; data-p=&quot;line&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;lineup&quot; id=&quot;bsn-line&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;div class=&quot;det&quot; id=&quot;bsn-det&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;p class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;Price is per 1M input tokens on Baseten Model APIs. Decision models produce no output tokens.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=&quot;foot&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;span&gt;Sources: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Baseten blog&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/baselabs/bison-1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;bison-1 card&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/baselabs/groundhog-1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;groundhog-1 card&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.liquid.ai/blog/d1-2&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Liquid AI&lt;/a&gt;. Scores self-reported.&lt;/span&gt;\n  &lt;span class=&quot;brand&quot;&gt;Built by Marktechpost&lt;/span&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;script&gt;\n(function(){\nvar R=document.getElementById('mtp-bsn-x');\nfunction q(s){return R.querySelector(s)} function qa(s){return R.querySelectorAll(s)}\nfunction resize(){try{var h=R.offsetHeight+40;parent.postMessage({mtpEmbed:'mtp-bsn-x',height:h},'*')}catch(e){}}\n/* tabs */\nqa('.tab').forEach(function(t){t.addEventListener('click',function(){\n qa('.tab').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('on')});t.classList.add('on');\n qa('.pane').forEach(function(p){p.classList.toggle('on',p.getAttribute('data-p')===t.getAttribute('data-t'))});\n if(t.getAttribute('data-t')==='bench')drawBars(cur);\n if(t.getAttribute('data-t')==='cal'){setLab(lab);calBars()}\n setTimeout(resize,60);\n})});\n/* how */\nvar caps=['The state holds the context: policies, conversation history and optional images, up to 128k tokens.','Attach any number of typed questions: noul (yes/no), choice (named options) or score (ordered levels).','The model reads everything in a single prefill pass. It never generates output tokens.','It returns P(yes), or the chosen option with a probabilities field. Your code branches on calibrated numbers.'];\nvar step=0,timer=null;\nfunction show(s){step=s;qa('.node').forEach(function(n){var i=+n.getAttribute('data-s');n.classList.toggle('lit',i&lt;=s)});\n qa('.dot').forEach(function(d,i){d.classList.toggle('on',i===s)});\n q('#bsn-cap').textContent=caps[s];\n qa('.node[data-s=&quot;3&quot;] .fill').forEach(function(f){f.style.width=(s&gt;=3?f.getAttribute('data-w'):0)+'%'});}\nq('#bsn-next').addEventListener('click',function(){stop();show((step+1)%4)});\nq('#bsn-prev').addEventListener('click',function(){stop();show((step+3)%4)});\nfunction stop(){if(timer){clearInterval(timer);timer=null;q('#bsn-play').textContent='▶ Auto-play'}}\nq('#bsn-play').addEventListener('click',function(){if(timer){stop();return}q('#bsn-play').textContent='❚❚ Pause';timer=setInterval(function(){show((step+1)%4)},1800)});\nshow(0);\n/* bench */\nvar data={\n idx:{max:100,rows:[['bison-1',76,'#1 of 19','#F5C754'],['Liquid d1.2-ultra',75,'','#5B5E58'],['mammoth-1',71,'','#5FD37C'],['groundhog-1',null,'Not yet scored','#C7A6F2']],note:'Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1, as reported by Baseten. Baseten expects groundhog-1 to match mammoth-1.'},\n cmp:{max:100,rows:[['When2Call',98,'#1','#F5C754'],['EvalSafe-O*NET-AA',93,'#1','#F5C754'],['AA-Symmetry v1.1',89,'#1','#F5C754'],['AA-Paperclip',73,'#2','#F5C754'],['AA-Omniscience-Dec.',60,'#11','#F08A5D'],['HLE-MultiChoice v1.1',51,'#1','#F5C754']],note:'bison-1 component scores and ranks from its Hugging Face model card. Orange marks its weakest rank.'},\n lme:{max:100,rows:[['bison-1 · M',84.8,'','#F5C754'],['groundhog-1 · M',77.4,'','#C7A6F2'],['bison-1 · S',87.1,'','#F5C754'],['groundhog-1 · S',79.3,'','#C7A6F2']],note:'LongMemEval M and S at 128k tokens, from Baseten\\'s own runs (model cards).'}\n};\nvar cur='idx';\nfunction drawBars(k){cur=k;var d=data[k],h='';\n d.rows.forEach(function(r){h+='&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;nm&quot;&gt;'+r[0]+(r[2]?'&lt;span class=&quot;rk&quot;&gt;'+r[2]+'&lt;/span&gt;':'')+'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;tr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;fl&quot; data-w=&quot;'+(r[1]===null?0:r[1]/d.max*100)+'&quot; style=&quot;background:'+r[3]+'&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vl&quot;&gt;'+(r[1]===null?'n/a':r[1])+'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;'});\n q('#bsn-bars').innerHTML=h;q('#bsn-bnote').textContent=d.note;\n setTimeout(function(){qa('#bsn-bars .fl').forEach(function(f){f.style.width=f.getAttribute('data-w')+'%'})},40);\n qa('#bsn-seg button').forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('on',b.getAttribute('data-b')===k)});setTimeout(resize,80);}\nqa('#bsn-seg button').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){drawBars(b.getAttribute('data-b'))})});\n/* calibration */\nvar lab='hard',L={hard:[1,0,0],soft:[0.7,0.2,0.1]},LC={hard:'A hard label says billing is 100% right and the rest are 0%. The model learns to be overconfident.',soft:'A soft label spreads probability across plausible answers. The model learns to state uncertainty honestly.'};\nfunction setLab(l){lab=l;L[l].forEach(function(v,i){q('#b'+i).style.height=(v*100)+'px';q('#d'+i).textContent=Math.round(v*100)+'%'});q('#bsn-lcap').textContent=LC[l];\n qa('#bsn-lab button').forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('on',b.getAttribute('data-l')===l)})}\nqa('#bsn-lab button').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){setLab(b.getAttribute('data-l'))})});\nfunction calBars(){qa('.pane[data-p=&quot;cal&quot;] .fl').forEach(function(f){f.style.width='0';setTimeout(function(){f.style.width=f.getAttribute('data-w')+'%'},40)})}\n/* lineup */\nvar M=[['joey-1','2B','Qwen3.5-2B','16k','$0.01','Latency or cost dominates',0],['elephant-1','9B','Qwen3.5-9B','16k','$0.035','Strong default at low latency',0],['mammoth-1','27B','Qwen3.5-27B','16k','$0.10','Knowledge-heavy decisions',0],['groundhog-1','26B MoE (~4B active)','Gemma 4 26B-A4B','128k','$0.035','Long context at low latency and cost',1],['bison-1','31B','Gemma 4 31B','128k','$0.10','Highest accuracy, long context',1]];\nvar lh='';M.forEach(function(m,i){lh+='&lt;button class=&quot;mdl'+(i===4?' on':'')+'&quot; data-i=&quot;'+i+'&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n&quot;&gt;'+m[0]+(m[6]?'&lt;span class=&quot;new&quot;&gt;NEW&lt;/span&gt;':'')+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot;&gt;'+m[1]+' · '+m[4]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;'});\nq('#bsn-line').innerHTML=lh;\nfunction det(i){var m=M[i];q('#bsn-det').innerHTML='&lt;div class=&quot;kv&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;Params&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;'+m[1]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kv&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;Backbone&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;'+m[2]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kv&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;Context&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;'+m[3]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kv&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;Per 1M tokens&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot;&gt;'+m[4]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;kv&quot; style=&quot;grid-column:1/-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;k&quot;&gt;Best for (per Baseten)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;v&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13.5px&quot;&gt;'+m[5]+'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;';\n qa('.mdl').forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('on',+b.getAttribute('data-i')===i)});setTimeout(resize,60)}\nqa('.mdl').forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener('click',function(){det(+b.getAttribute('data-i'))})});\ndet(4);\nwindow.addEventListener('load',resize);window.addEventListener('resize',resize);setTimeout(resize,300);\n})();\n&lt;/script&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></iframe>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-does-it-compare-with-other-decision-models\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How does it compare with other decision models?</strong></h2>\n  <figure class=\"wp-block-table\">\n   <table class=\"has-fixed-layout\">\n    <thead>\n     <tr>\n      <th>Feature</th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/bison-1\">bison-1</a></th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/groundhog-1\">groundhog-1</a></th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/mammoth-1\">mammoth-1</a></th>\n      <th><a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/d1-2\">Liquid d1.2-ultra</a></th>\n     </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Total params</td>\n      <td>31B dense</td>\n      <td>26B MoE</td>\n      <td>27B</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Active params</td>\n      <td>31B</td>\n      <td>~4B</td>\n      <td>27B</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Backbone</td>\n      <td>Gemma 4 31B</td>\n      <td>Gemma 4 26B-A4B</td>\n      <td>Qwen3.5-27B</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Context</td>\n      <td>128k</td>\n      <td>128k</td>\n      <td>16k</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/liquid/d1.2-ultra/providers\">65,536</a></td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Input</td>\n      <td>Text, image</td>\n      <td>Text, image</td>\n      <td>Text, image</td>\n      <td>Text, image, audio</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>License</td>\n      <td>MIT + Apache 2.0</td>\n      <td>MIT + Apache 2.0</td>\n      <td>MIT</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Weights</td>\n      <td>Open (Hugging Face)</td>\n      <td>Open (Hugging Face)</td>\n      <td>Open (Hugging Face)</td>\n      <td>Liquid API (weights not disclosed)</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>AA Decision Index v2.1</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/\">76</a></td>\n      <td>Not yet scored</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/\">71</a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/d1-2\">75</a></td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Brier score</td>\n      <td>0.14</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/\">0.15</a> (per Baseten)</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>LongMemEval M (128k)</td>\n      <td>84.8</td>\n      <td>77.4</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td>Price per 1M input tokens</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/library/bison-1/\">$0.10</a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/groundhog-1\">$0.035</a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/\">$0.10</a></td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.liquid.ai/blog/d1-2\">$0.042</a></td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n  </figure>\n  <h2 id=\"h-how-can-developers-deploy-bison-1-and-groundhog-1\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How can developers deploy bison-1 and groundhog-1?</strong></h2>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both models are live on <a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/products/model-apis/\">Baseten Model APIs</a>. They use the same API as the older decision models, so switching means changing 1 model name. The IDs are <code>decision-models/baseten-bison-latest</code> and <code>decision-models/baseten-groundhog-latest</code>.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pricing mirrors the older pair. bison-1 costs $0.10 per 1M tokens, like mammoth-1. groundhog-1 costs $0.035, like elephant-1. The <a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/library/bison-1/\">bison-1 library page</a> lists that as an input price, since no output tokens are produced.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Open BF16 weights sit on Hugging Face. Baseten lists no inference GPU or quantized builds. Training used 192 B200 GPUs for bison-1 and 128 for groundhog-1.</p>\n  <h2 id=\"h-key-takeaways\" class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Key Takeaways</strong></h2>\n  <ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n   <li>bison-1 tops AA Decision Index v2.1 at 76, 1 point over d1.2-ultra.</li>\n   <li>Context jumps 8x to 128k, with image input on both models.</li>\n   <li>groundhog-1 runs about 4B active params at $0.035 per 1M tokens.</li>\n   <li>Soft-label training helps push bison-1’s Brier score to 0.14.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\">\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Check out the<strong> <a href=\"https://www.baseten.co/blog/meet-bison-1-and-groundhog-1/\">launch post</a></strong>, the <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/bison-1\"><strong>bison-1</strong></a> and <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/baselabs/groundhog-1\"><strong>groundhog-1</strong></a> model cards, and the <a href=\"https://docs.baseten.co/\"><strong>Baseten docs</strong></a>. You can check the deployment options and specs here through our <strong><a href=\"https://aicampaign.live/gpu-1\">GPULeaderboard.com chrome extension</a></strong>.</p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Also,&nbsp;feel free to follow us on&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://x.com/intent/follow?screen_name=marktechpost\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Twitter</mark></a></strong>&nbsp;and don’t forget to join our&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/machinelearningnews/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">150k+ML SubReddit</a></strong>&nbsp;and Subscribe to&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/11/08/google-elephant-goldfish-model-plugin-spec-review-coding-agents/#aids-signup\">our Newsletter</a></strong>. Wait! are you on telegram?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://t.me/machinelearningresearchnews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">now you can join us on telegram as well.</a></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Need to partner with us for promoting your GitHub Repo OR Hugging Face Page OR Product Release OR Webinar etc.?&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://promotions.marktechpost.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><mark>Connect with us</mark></a></strong></p>\n  <!-- MOLONGUI AUTHORSHIP PLUGIN 5.3.2 -->\n  <!-- https://www.molongui.com/wordpress-plugin-post-authors -->\n  <div class=\"m-a-box \" data-box-layout=\"slim\" data-box-position=\"below\" data-multiauthor=\"false\" data-author-id=\"1\" data-author-type=\"user\" data-author-archived=\"\">\n   <div class=\"m-a-box-container\">\n    <div class=\"m-a-box-tab m-a-box-content m-a-box-profile\" data-profile-layout=\"layout-1\" data-author-ref=\"user-1\" itemscope itemid=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Person\">\n     <div class=\"m-a-box-content-middle\">\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-avatar\" data-source=\"local\">\n       <a class=\"m-a-box-avatar-url\" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png\" class=\"avatar avatar-150 photo\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-150x150.png 150w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-80x80.png 80w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-24x24.png 24w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-48x48.png 48w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-96x96.png 96w, https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM-300x300.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" data-attachment-id=\"17663\" data-permalink=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/?attachment_id=17663\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\" data-orig-size=\"832,778\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Screen Shot 2021-09-14 at 9.02.24 AM\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Screen-Shot-2021-09-14-at-9.02.24-AM.png\"></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-social \">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-facebook m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MarkTechPost/\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Facebook profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-facebook\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-twitter m-ico-\" href=\"https://twitter.com/asifrazzaq1988\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Twitter profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-twitter\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-social-icon m-a-list-social-icon\">\n        <a class=\"m-icon-container m-ico-linkedin m-ico-\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/asifrazzaq/\" target=\"_blank\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" aria-label=\"View Asif Razzaq's Linkedin profile\"><i class=\"m-a-icon-linkedin\"></i></a>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-data\">\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-name\">\n        <h5 itemprop=\"name\"><a class=\"m-a-box-name-url \" href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com/author/6flvq/\" itemprop=\"url\"> Asif Razzaq</a></h5>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-item m-a-box-meta\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.marktechpost.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-web\">Website</span></a>&nbsp;<span class=\"m-a-box-meta-divider\">|</span>&nbsp;<a href=\"#\" class=\"m-a-box-data-toggle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span class=\"m-a-box-string-more-posts\">+ posts</span></a>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-bio\" itemprop=\"description\">\n        <p>Asif Razzaq is the CEO of Marktechpost AI Media Inc.. As a visionary entrepreneur and engineer, Asif is committed to harnessing the potential of Artificial Intelligence for social good. His most recent endeavor is the launch of an Artificial Intelligence Media Platform, Marktechpost, which stands out for its in-depth coverage of machine learning and deep learning news that is both technically sound and easily understandable by a wide audience. The platform boasts of over 2 million monthly views, illustrating its popularity among audiences.</p>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"m-a-box-related\" data-related-layout=\"layout-1\"></div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!-- CONTENT END 2 -->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Baseten 发布了 bison-1（31B 稠密模型）和 groundhog-1（26B MoE），这两款基于 Google Gemma 4 的开放权重决策模型将上下文扩展至 128k tokens 并支持图像输入；其中 bison-1 在 Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1 中以 76 分排名第 1。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Baseten 发布了 bison-1（31B 稠密模型）和 groundhog-1（26B MoE），这两款基于 Google Gemma 4 的开放权重决策模型将上下文扩展至 128k tokens 并支持图像输入；其中 bison-1 在 Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1 中以 76 分排名第 1。",
  "summary": "Baseten 发布了 bison-1 和 groundhog-1，这两款开放权重决策模型基于 Google Gemma 4 架构构建。bison-1 是 31B 稠密模型，groundhog-1 则是 26B 混合专家模型，每个 token 激活约 4B 参数。两款模型都将上下文窗口从 16k 扩展至 128k tokens，并支持图像输入，因此可在单次 API 调用中处理完整的策略和历史记录。bison-1 在 Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1 中获得 76 分，在 19 款模型中排名第 1，比 Liquid AI 的 d1.2-ultra（75）高 1 分。该模型的校准能力也更强，布里尔分数为 0.14，是该指数中最低的。在各项基准测试中，bison-1 在 When2Call（98）、EvalSafe-O*NET-AA（93）、AA-Symmetry v1.1（89）和 HLE-MultiChoice v1.1（51）上均排名第 1，但在 AA-Omniscience-Decision v1.1（60）上排名第 11，显示其在知识密集型决策方面存在不足。两款模型均可通过 Baseten Model APIs 使用，bison-1 的定价为每 1M 输入 tokens $0.10，groundhog-1 为 $0.035。开放的 BF16 权重托管于 Hugging Face，采用 MIT + Apache 2.0 许可证。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "bison-1 在 Artificial Analysis Decision Index v2.1 中获得 76 分，在 19 款模型中排名第 1。",
      "explanation": "这使 bison-1 超过 Liquid AI 的 d1.2-ultra（75）和 Baseten 自家的 mammoth-1（71）。该指数综合了 6 项评测，其中 AA-Paperclip 的权重最高，为 30%。"
    },
    {
      "point": "两款模型都将上下文扩展至 128k tokens，并支持图像输入，因此可在单次 API 调用中处理完整的策略和历史记录。",
      "explanation": "上下文窗口从此前的 16k 扩大了 8 倍，使路由、分流和护栏流程能够处理完整历史记录而不截断；图像支持也拓宽了模型在多模态决策任务中的适用范围。"
    },
    {
      "point": "bison-1 的校准能力更强，布里尔分数为 0.14，是该指数中最低的。",
      "explanation": "Baseten 将此归因于训练中使用了更多软标签，即采用概率目标而非固定的正确答案。这有助于模型学会报告与实际准确率相符的不确定性。"
    },
    {
      "point": "groundhog-1 每 1M 输入 tokens 的价格为 $0.035，且每个 token 仅激活约 4B 参数，可作为高性价比替代方案。",
      "explanation": "groundhog-1 是一款 26B MoE 模型，每个 token 激活约 4B 参数，适合成本优先的应用场景，但目前没有官方的 AA Decision Index 评分。"
    }
  ],
